"HELP response: Flexible Timers sends account verification codes and\n      reminder SMS you schedule for yourself. Help:\n      https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html. Reply STOP to opt out." = "HELP-antwoord: Flexible Timers verstuurt accountverificatiecodes en sms-herinneringen die u voor uzelf plant. Hulp: https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html. Antwoord STOP om u af te melden.";
